    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/687f29f74e94ef138e1e1c477850972d.avif?t=1714844731\" width=618 height=218 /></span><br>Diverse Airports<br>A wide range of airports of various sizes and structures awaits you, each presenting a unique challenge for your team. From small regional airports to massive international terminals, you'll need to rebuild them from scratch. You'll face diverse tasks when recreating each airport, and only your management skills and creative approach will turn them into successful air traffic centers again.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/1796f1b175e348388184a0b600280b39.poster.avif?t=1714844731\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/1796f1b175e348388184a0b600280b39.webm?t=1714844731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/1796f1b175e348388184a0b600280b39.mp4?t=1714844731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Design and Renovation<br>Plan different zones of the airport, optimize passenger flows, develop modern passenger halls, customs points, runways, and other facilities. Choose from a variety of design elements to create a unique and functional airport.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/9eaf82a96aceedd6fb9443a0a1037a1a.poster.avif?t=1714844731\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/9eaf82a96aceedd6fb9443a0a1037a1a.webm?t=1714844731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/9eaf82a96aceedd6fb9443a0a1037a1a.mp4?t=1714844731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Team Management<br>To undertake the airport renovation, you'll need assistance. Assemble a team of various specialists such as architects, engineers, interior designers, and workers to ensure the quality execution of the work. Manage the budget, monitor resources to successfully complete the project.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/b4ec7f9c8560b0f9bb9d07702661107b.poster.avif?t=1714844731\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/b4ec7f9c8560b0f9bb9d07702661107b.webm?t=1714844731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/b4ec7f9c8560b0f9bb9d07702661107b.mp4?t=1714844731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Realism<br>The game recreates the atmosphere of a real airport, emphasizing details and realistic graphics. Passengers will react to changes in the environment, and your airport will be evaluated based on various parameters such as safety, efficiency, and passenger satisfaction.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/0df4d4ea63cad191acebafe7dc2d2d9d.poster.avif?t=1714844731\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/0df4d4ea63cad191acebafe7dc2d2d9d.webm?t=1714844731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/0df4d4ea63cad191acebafe7dc2d2d9d.mp4?t=1714844731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenges and Rewards<br>Complete various tasks and challenges to earn resources and improve your skills. Successfully accomplishing tasks will bring you rewards and unlock new opportunities for airport development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/8de7d3528813b1c57f68b2f1597147a3.avif?t=1714844731\" width=618 height=218 /></span>",
