allenges and Rewards<br>Complete various tasks and challenges to earn resources and improve your skills. Successfully accomplishing tasks will bring you rewards and unlock new opportunities for airport development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2604800/extras/8de7d3528813b1c57f68b2f1597147a3.avif?t=1714844731\" width=618 height=218 /></span>",
